    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/884021bdea2983574e453d6f33085f7c.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/884021bdea2983574e453d6f33085f7c.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>City-building meets deck-building in Chaos Islands. Defend against demons, explore the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/7af3239a7d695853da01fb059b1703f0.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish and expand your floating settlement in the skies, strategically placing structures to gather essential resources. Raise defenses to protect against demon attacks and ensure the survival of your community. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/b362ed4c7b4b91d2c94170801b688d0d.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/b362ed4c7b4b91d2c94170801b688d0d.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/c5c63f7b06b965ed662c5509ff87b4e6.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=219 /></span>Defend your settlement with diverse strategies and card abilities to repel demon assaults and keep your settlement safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/78b28239f8d5c5d2edf4cc7630dc4a7f.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/78b28239f8d5c5d2edf4cc7630dc4a7f.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/33fdaeb59f999f0b564a3cfe4c3b9d36.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=219 /></span>Customize your arsenal by collecting cards that represent various constructions and spells empowering you to adapt and overcome the challenges of the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/ee58828285da6415c4ef9e51aa21ac08.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/ee58828285da6415c4ef9e51aa21ac08.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/8e3aac3c464e95b19107c79e346207a1.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=219 /></span>Navigate through dynamic events that shape the fate of your settlement, presenting both opportunities and challenges as you strive to survive in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/52c6fd2eee7b477be9b8931b1e6a922b.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/52c6fd2eee7b477be9b8931b1e6a922b.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/884021bdea2983574e453d6f33085f7c.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/884021bdea2983574e453d6f33085f7c.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>City-building meets deck-building in Chaos Islands. Defend against demons, explore the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/7af3239a7d695853da01fb059b1703f0.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish and expand your floating settlement in the skies, strategically placing structures to gather essential resources. Raise defenses to protect against demon attacks and ensure the survival of your community. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/b362ed4c7b4b91d2c94170801b688d0d.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/b362ed4c7b4b91d2c94170801b688d0d.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/c5c63f7b06b965ed662c5509ff87b4e6.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=219 /></span>Defend your settlement with diverse strategies and card abilities to repel demon assaults and keep your settlement safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/78b28239f8d5c5d2edf4cc7630dc4a7f.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/78b28239f8d5c5d2edf4cc7630dc4a7f.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/33fdaeb59f999f0b564a3cfe4c3b9d36.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=219 /></span>Customize your arsenal by collecting cards that represent various constructions and spells empowering you to adapt and overcome the challenges of the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/ee58828285da6415c4ef9e51aa21ac08.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/ee58828285da6415c4ef9e51aa21ac08.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/8e3aac3c464e95b19107c79e346207a1.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=219 /></span>Navigate through dynamic events that shape the fate of your settlement, presenting both opportunities and challenges as you strive to survive in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/52c6fd2eee7b477be9b8931b1e6a922b.poster.avif?t=1732561450\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/52c6fd2eee7b477be9b8931b1e6a922b.webm?t=1732561450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Chaos Islands is a city-builder that unites deck-building and tower defense mechanics with roguelite elements. As the last bastion of humanity forced to escape to the skies to hide from invading forces of demons. Protect your settlement and do not let the evil forces pass.",
